[type."Piece"]
rules = ["assert(0 <= start && start <= end; message: \"a piece ends after it starts\")"]
-- a narrower rule
warning[NK1208]: the rule of `Piece` asks more of its consumers than the committed ledger says.
   = note: it was `0 <= start && start <= end; message: "a piece ends after it starts"`, and now is `0 <= start && start < end; message: "a piece ends after it starts"`.
   = note: a consumer's value of it that kept the rule before may now stop where it is built or written.
   = help: if that is meant, commit `nikaia.contracts`, and this is not said again.
